摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Open DeepSeek Harness workspace directories in VS Code directly from the web GUI.","id":"gh:1333068322","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-open-in-vscode","slug":"omdsh-dev/dsh-open-in-vscode","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Open DeepSeek Harness workspace directories in VS Code directly from the web GUI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-open-in-vscode"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Open a workspace directory in VS Code straight from the DeepSeek Harness web\nGUI: every real Workspa"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ce row in the sidebar gains an **Open in VSCode** row\ninside its **…** overflow menu."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- The client half uses the harness's `sidebar.workspaces.row-menu` slot when\navailable and falls bac"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"k to a scoped compatibility adapter on the public\nDSH `0.1.0-rc.6` build. Both paths render the same"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" locale-following menu row\n— **在 VSCode 中打开** under the Chinese locale, **Open in VSCode** under\nEng"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"lish.\n- The row's click closes the menu and calls the host over the strict Typert\nRemote `openInVsco"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"de/open`, passing the workspace directory.\n- The host half spawns the configured editor CLI on that "},{"id":"p5s6","text":"directory\n(`code <path>` by default), detached, so the editor outlives the server."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- VS Code, or an editor CLI on PATH. On Windows, the default `code` command\nalso discovers standard "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"per-user and system VS Code installations. On macOS,\ninstall the\nVS Code shell command\nor set the pl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ugin `command` to any editor that opens a directory).\n- DSH `0.1.0-rc.6` or newer. The plugin uses t"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"he native Workspace row-menu\nextension point where present and a compatibility adapter on `rc.6`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Add the plugin to your web profile (this runs pnpm inside the profile and\nreconciles the bundle laye"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" the plugin to your web profile (this runs pnpm inside the profile and\nreconciles the bundle layer):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart the web server (`kill -TERM <pid>` and wait for exit — never\n`kill -9`, it tears the session"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" zstd log mid-frame), then refresh the page.\nThe host plugin mounts under `dsh-open-in-vscode`; the "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"client bundle is\nserved at `/plugins/dsh-open-in-vscode/client.js`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The versioned tarball replaces older pinned commits without running a git\n`prepare` script. Confirm "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"the installed version with:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Deployment-varying choices are validated `Config` fields, changeable from\ncordis.yml:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `command` | `code` | Executable that opens a directory. The default also probes standard Windows V"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"S Code install locations; other commands resolve through PATH. |\n| `args` | `[]` | Extra arguments p"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"assed before the directory path. |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"A missing executable fails loud with a fix hint; relative paths are refused."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Capability boundary"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Action | Runs where | Requires approval |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Open a workspace directory in the editor | Host (user gesture) | No — the user clicked the row |\n|"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" Anything else | — | The plugin has no tools, no settings namespace, and no model-facing surface |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin adds no tools, no skills, and no settings; it only opens the\ndirectory the user already o"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"pened in DSH. It never reads or writes files\nitself."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Layout: the wire contract lives in one module (`src/contract.ts`) shared by\nthe host manifest (`src/"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"typert.ts`) and the client contribution\n(`src/client/remote.ts`); the harness owns the slot declarat"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ion and the\nMenu node-entry kind this plugin composes through."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
